keywords:
  - large language models
  - ensemble diversity
  - Vendi Score
  - psychotherapy case formulation
  - effective number of voices
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and data for a study of the effective diversity of a
  sixteen-model language model ensemble on psychotherapeutic case formulation.
  The effective number of voices is the Vendi Score, computed with the reference
  implementation rather than reimplemented; the per-voice dissent contribution is
  original to the study. Includes the per-run indices, the per-model dissent
  contributions and the 7,200 formulations obtained. The vignette bank is held in
  a separate restricted deposit.
references:
